   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Tabs\n\nA tab bar: a pointer clicks each tab in turn, the indicator slides to it, the label darkens and the panel text cross-fades.\n\nCategory: ui. Length: 4.5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A settings or dashboard demo needs to switch sections with an animated indicator.\n- Showing tab navigation with content that changes underneath.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A segmented single-choice control without panels: use toggle-group.\n- A multi-step wizard: use stepper.\n\nVariables:\n- items (string): Tabs, default \"Account, Password, Settings\"\n- contents (string): Panel texts, default \"Make changes to your account here.|Change your password here.|Manage your notification settings.\"\n- content_height (number, 24-200): Panel height, default 72\n- variant (enum): Variant, default \"pill\"\n- mode (enum): Theme, default \"light\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent background, default false\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
